### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

###
### Get all notes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notes

###
### Create a note
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Boot Basics",
  "content": "Spring Boot is a framework for building stand-alone, production-grade Spring-based applications with minimal configuration."
}

###
### AI enrich note (sets summary + tags)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notes/1/ai-enrich

###
### Get note by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notes/1

###
### Update note content/title (resets summary + tags)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Boot Advanced Concepts",
  "content": "Deep dive into Spring Boot with advanced configuration, dependency injection, and testing strategies."
}

###
### Re-run AI enrich after update
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notes/1/ai-enrich

###
### Delete a note
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notes/1
